+# Accounts Service
+
+Terminology for customer accounts and the staff operations that support them.
+
+## Language
+
+**Account note**:
+A staff-authored piece of information attached to an account, recording its body, author, creation time, and whether it is internal.
+_Avoid_: account comment, memo
+
+**Internal note**:
+An account note marked for staff-only handling; it is not customer-visible.
+_Avoid_: private note
